*chippy* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

Chippy interpreter and toolchain

*Usage:*

  ''chippy''                          Start the REPL
  ''chippy <program> [args...]''      Run a program

  ''chippy -r "code"''                Execute code directly
  ''chippy --run "code"''             Execute code directly

  ''chippy -v''                       Show version information
  ''chippy --version''                Show version information

  ''chippy -h''                       Show this help message
  ''chippy --help''                   Show this help message

*Commands:*

  *Documentation*
  ''chippy doc''                              List all documentation topics
  ''chippy doc <topic>''                      View documentation for a topic

  ''chippy doc <file.chpdoc>''                Render chpdoc to terminal

  ''chippy doc <file>''                       List symbols in source file
  ''chippy doc <file> <symbol>''              Show symbol documentation
  ''chippy doc <file> all''                   Show all symbol documentation

  *Combine*
  ''chippy combine''                          Bundle a project
  ''chippy combine <config>''                 Bundle a project with an explicit combine config file
  ''chippy combine new''                      Create a new combine.chp file

  ''chippy combine test''                     Run the project's test suite
  ''chippy combine test <file>''              Run the tests in one test file
  ''chippy combine test <pattern>''           Run the tests whose names match a pattern
  ''chippy combine test <file> <pattern>''    Run the matching tests in one test file
  ''chippy combine <config> test ...''        Any of the above with an explicit combine config file

  ''chippy combine run''                      Run the project without writing a bundle
  ''chippy combine run <args...>''            Run the project with command line arguments
  ''chippy combine <config> run <args...>''   Any of the above with an explicit combine config file

  *Check*
  ''chippy check <files...>''                 Check files for errors
  ''chippy check all [dir]''                  Check ''.chp'' and ''.chh'' files recursively

  *Format*
  ''chippy format <files...>''                Format files
  ''chippy format all [dir]''                 Format ''.chp'' and ''.chh'' files recursively

  ''chippy format check <files...>''          Report which files need formatting
  ''chippy format check all [dir]''           Report recursively which files need formatting

  *Compile*
  ''chippy compile <source>''                 Compile a program to a bytecode file
  ''chippy compile <source> [out]''           Compile a program to a bytecode file named ''out''

  *Disassembler*
  ''chippy disasm <file>''                    Disassemble and output a program's bytecode

*Recommended Reading*

''chippy doc combine''
''chippy doc testing''
